<title>JAMAICA: CRICKET-INDIA 108 FOR ONE AT CLOSE V W.INDIES.</title>
<headline>CRICKET-INDIA 108 FOR ONE AT CLOSE V W.INDIES.</headline>
<dateline>KINGSTON 1997-03-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>India, replying to the West Indies first innings total of 427, were 108 for one at the close on the second day of the first test at Sabina Park on Friday.</p>
<p>Scores: West Indies 427 all out (C.Hooper 129, B.Lara 83, S.Chanderpaul 52, A.Kumble 5-120). India 108-1 (V.V.Laxman 54 not out).</p>
